        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "This tool looks up the active shift schedule for agents.\n\nIt returns a record with these fields:\n- AgentName: OPS-Ahmet, OPS-Islam, or OPS-Tarek\n- StartHour (24h, Turkish time)\n- EndHour (24h, Turkish time)\n- WeekendDay (0=Sunday, … 6=Saturday)\n- Email: the official company email of the agent\n- Status: Active or Inactive\n\nUsage rules:\n- Always use this tool to check which agent is on duty.\n- Only choose from the agents it returns as active right now.\n- If multiple active agents are returned, distribute tasks fairly (round-robin).\n- If no agent is active, set Assign to = “Unassigned” and leave empty in Notion.\n- Use AgentName for Notion “Assign to”.\n- Use Email to CC the Gmail notification.\n- Never share Airtable or shift details with the client.\n",
